  "status": "present",
  "value": "Kahn's algorithm processed level by level: in-degree counts, the current frontier sorted, successors whose in-degree drops to 0 form the next frontier. Complexity target: O((n + m) + n log n) time/O(n + m) space.",
  "provenance": [
